    "description": "Nestled in the highly sought after Bernal Heights neighborhood, this delightful one-bedroom, one-bathroom home blends\nthe classic character with modern updates. Recently refreshed, the interior and exterior boast fresh paint, refinished hardwood floors,\n and updated fixtures, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere.\nThe cozy living space is bathed in natural light, as is the updated bathroom which features a fabulous skylight\nwhile the kitchen features stainless steel appliances and a charming French door that opens up to one side of the spacious patio.\nThe serene bedroom offers a private retreat with its own French door leading to a beautifully secluded backyard-perfect\nfor gardening, entertaining, or simply unwinding. Take a few steps further back in the yard to enjoy stunning city views.\nAdding to the home's convenience, the attached garage with remote, includes laundry and offers direct access to both the interior\nand backyard.\nLocated on Banks street, this home is just moments from schools, parks, coffee shops, and the vibrant energy that Cortland Avenue\nhas to offer. It is conveniently located near freeway access for seamless commuting.\nThis delightful home has incredible potential for expansion as displayed by other homes in the neighborhood.\nThis gem is a must see!"
  },
